      "text": "arXiv:hep-th/9211141v1 1 Dec 1992 — 17 sections: Front matter; INTRODUCTION AND SUMMARY OF RESULT; The System of Partial Differential\n\n**arXiv:hep-th/9211141v1 1 Dec 1992**\n\n*Level-Spacing Distributions and the Airy Kernel*\n\n34 pp, 17 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 INTRODUCTION AND SUMMARY OF RESULTS; 1.2 The System of Partial Differential Equatio; 1.3 The Ordinary Differential Equations; 1.4 Asymptotics and the Commuting Differential; 1.5 Probability Density for the $n^{th}$ Large; 2 THE SYSTEM OF PARTIAL DIFFERENTIAL EQUATIONS; 2.1 Derivation of the Equations; 2.2 Hamiltonian Structure; 3 THE ORDINARY DIFFERENTIAL EQUATIONS; 4 ASYMPTOTICS; 4.1 Asymptotics via Painlev'e; 4.2 Asymptotics via the Commuting Differential; 4.2.1 The region $x<<t^{-1/2}$; 4.2.2 The region $x>>t^{-2}$, $t-x>>t^{1/4}$; 4.2.3 The region $x-t>>t^{1/4}$; 4.2.5 The asymptotics of $\\lambda_i$",
